=== foglight_intro ===
Fog fills the low ground of Foglight Heights, and every snail climbs to the nearest high place and stays there.
Brume sits on a small hill and calls it the top of the world.
-> END

=== foglight_climbed ===
Brume stands on the high meadow, and the fog lies far below you both.
To get here, you had to go down first.
-> END

=== foglight_close_call ===
Brume stays on its small hill, and the high meadow stays hidden in the cloud.
-> END

=== foglight_postcard ===
A snail is setting off toward Kith and will carry one card, slowly. Which one?
-> END

=== foglight_sent ===
The snail goes down into the fog with your card, and does not hurry.
-> END
